  "content": {
    "title": "World Baseball Classic 2026 host stadiums and cities for every game",
    "text": "March 5, 2026, 6:30 a.m. ETThe 2026 World Baseball Classic will be held at four different venues – Tokyo Dome in Japan, Hiram Bithorn Stadium in Puerto Rico, Daikin Park in Houston and LoanDepot Park in Miami.This year's tournament also marks the second consecutive time that Miami will host the World Baseball Classic semifinals and final. Japan defeated the United States in a dramatic final in 2023.The Tokyo Dome has served as a World Baseball Classic venue for all six editions, while Hiram Bithorn Stadium is hosting for the fifth time. While LoanDepot Park is hosting World Baseball Classic games for the fourth time, this is the first time for Daikin Park, home of the Houston Astros.Here's a look at the stadiums hosting World Baseball Classic games and the tournament schedule at those venues:World Baseball Classic 2026 host stadiums and cities for every game(All times Eastern)Daikin ParkLocation: HoustonPrimary tenant: Houston AstrosWorld Baseball Classic 2026 schedule:March 6 - Mexico vs. Great Britain, 1 p.m. (FS1)March 6 - USA vs. Brazil, 8 p.m. (FOX)Match 7 - Brazil vs. Italy, 1 p.m. (FOX Sports app)March 7 - Great Britain vs. USA, 8 p.m. (FOX)March 8 - Great Britain vs. Italy, 1 p.m. (Tubi)March 8 - Brazil vs. Mexico, 8 p.m. (FS1)March 9 - Brazil vs. Great Britain, 1 p.m. (Tubi)March 9 - Mexico vs. USA, 8 p.m. (FOX)March 10 - Italy vs. USA, 9 p.m. (FS1)March 11 - Italy vs. Mexico, 7 p.m. (Tubi)March 13 - Quarterfinal 2 (San Juan pool runner-up vs. Houston pool winner), 8 p.m. (FOX)March 14 - Quarterfinal 3 (Houston pool runner-up vs. San Juan pool winner), 3 p.m. (FS1)Hiram Bithorn StadiumLocation: San Juan, Puerto RicoPrimary tenants: Senadores de San Juan and Cangrejeros de Santurce (LBPRC)World Baseball Classic 2026 schedule:March 6 - Cuba vs. Panama, 11 a.m. (FS2)March 6 - Puerto Rico vs. Colombia, 6 p.m. (FS1)March 7 - Colombia vs. Canada, 11 a.m. (FS2)March 7 - Panama vs. Puerto Rico, 6 p.m. (FS1)March 8 - Colombia vs. Cuba, 12 p.m. (FS2)March 8 - Panama vs. Canada, 7 p.m. (FS2)March 9 - Colombia vs. Panama, 12 p.m. (FS2)March 9 - Cuba vs. Puerto Rico, 7 p.m. (FS1)March 10 - Canada vs. Puerto Rico, 7 p.m. (Tubi)March 11 - Canada vs. Cuba, 3 p.m. (FS2)LoanDepot ParkLocation: MiamiPrimary tenant: Miami MarlinsWorld Baseball Classic 2026 schedule:March 6 - Netherlands vs. Venezuela, 12 p.m. (Tubi)March 6 - Nicaragua vs. Dominican Republic, 7 p.m. (FS2)March 7 - Nicaragua vs. Netherlands, 12 p.m. (Tubi)March 7 - Israel vs. Venezuela, 7 p.m. (FS2)March 8 - Netherlands vs. Dominican Republic, 12 p.m. (FOX)March 8 - Nicaragua vs. Israel, 7 p.m. (Tubi)March 9 - Dominican Republic vs. Israel, 12 p.m. (FS1)March 9 - Venezuela vs. Nicaragua, 7 p.m. (FS2)March 10 - Israel vs. Netherlands, 7 p.m. (FOX Sports app)March 11 - Dominican Republic vs. Venezuela, 8 p.m. (FS1)March 13 - Quarterfinal 1 (Tokyo pool runner-up vs. Miami pool winner), 6:30 p.m. (FS2)March 14 - Quarterfinal 4 (Miami pool runner-up vs. Tokyo pool winner), 9 p.m. (FOX)March 15 - Semifinal (QF1 winner vs. QF2 winner), 8 p.m. (FS1)March 16 - Semifinal (QF 3 winner vs. QF4 winner), 8 p.m. (FS1)March 17 - Championship game, 8 p.m. (FOX)Tokyo DomeLocation: Tokyo, JapanPrimary tenant: Yomiuri Giants (NPB)World Baseball Classic 2026 schedule:March 4 - Chinese Taipei vs. Australia, 10 p.m. (FS1)March 5 - Czechia vs. Korea, 5 a.m. (FS1)March 5 - Australia vs. Czechia, 10 p.m. (FS1)March 6 - Japan vs. Chinese Taipei, 5 a.m. (FS1)March 6 - Chinese Taipei vs. Czechia, 10 p.m. (FS2)March 7 - Korea vs. Japan, 5 a.m. (FS1)March 7 - Chinese Taipei vs. Korea, 10 p.m. (FS2)March 8 - Australia vs. Japan, 6 a.m. (FS1)March 9 - Korea vs. Australia, 6 a.m. (FS1)March 10 - Czechia vs. Japan, 6 a.m. (FS1)",
